"d002/f579"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "2461983f",
"en_raw": "Perfect night for it, a full moon"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "fa8eb9e0",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "35273770",
"en_raw": "That curse"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "5e95169d",
"en_raw": "What if it's actually real?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "cb92ddd9",
"en_raw": "Within 100 days"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "11df8307",
"en_raw": "you die, right?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "260ff3e3",
"en_raw": "Big talk for someone who doesn't believe it"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "7cfb1dfd",
"en_raw": "But my cram school friends said so too"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "df55acaa",
"en_raw": "A friend of that person's senior"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "9b0fdb77",
"en_raw": "really saw it, and died, apparently..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "de9f371a",
"en_raw": "Do you know what that kind of story is called?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "9c515849",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "f183c6a3",
"en_raw": "It's called F.O.A.F., you know"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "0c419e1c",
"en_raw": "The most textbook kind of rumor there is"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "7a6c9ec1",
"en_raw": "Got it, Nao?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "e7e7dd7a",
"en_raw": "That was priceless, Nao"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "01a0e9f9",
"en_raw": "Who'd have thought, in front of Shiina"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "ef46e26e",
"en_raw": "you'd just collapse"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "f1edb90c",
"en_raw": "But I saw it!"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "6cddac80",
"en_raw": "A black shadow like a bird..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "ca7557ff",
"en_raw": "A girl's..."
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "345a2a5d",
"en_raw": "So..."
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "3e529844",
"en_raw": "Just like the rumor said..."
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "c2955595",
"en_raw": "Shiina, did you see it?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "52a6e0d4",
"en_raw": "No. I want ice cream"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "2ded170b",
"en_raw": "...is what happened"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "1ac70abf",
"en_raw": "So basically, Nao, you"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "7af12fbc",
"en_raw": "imagined things from a rumor you heard"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "f1022997",
"en_raw": "and fainted all on your own"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "d3e3fa07",
"en_raw": "Obsessive thinking"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "ca825d95",
"en_raw": "is what they call it, right?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "09bd3e38",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "a9f16926",
"en_raw": "No buts"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "87029d8b",
"en_raw": "A rumor like this, everyone's going to"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "f2014569",
"en_raw": "forget about it in no time"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "c267041b",
"en_raw": "So there's no point"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "38f2ef21",
"en_raw": "letting it get to you"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}